    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Class generated from source table 'PlaylistTrack'.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An association class representing the membership of a track in a playlist. Each instance links exactly one playlist to exactly one track, forming a many-to-many relationship between playlists and tracks. The composite primary key (PlaylistId, TrackId) ensures a track appears at most once in a given playlist.</rdfs:comment>
